{
  "declaredLength": 2784,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르 경찰은 포켓몬에게\n수사 협조를 부탁할 때가 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B9740020ACBDCC30C7400020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0AC8C000AC218C0AC0020D611C870B97C0020BD80D0C1D5600020B54CAC000020C788C5B4002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "최근에는 어둠대신이라는\n포켓몬의 특징에 주목하고 있지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD5CADFCC5D0B2940020C5B4B460B300C2E0C774B77CB294000AD3ECCF13BAACC7580020D2B9C9D5C5D00020C8FCBAA9D558ACE00020C788C9C0002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어둠대신은 인간의 원한이나 질투 같은\n부정적인 감정을 좋아하거든.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B460B300C2E0C7400020C778AC04C7580020C6D0D55CC774B0980020C9C8D22C0020AC19C740000ABD80C815C801C7780020AC10C815C7440020C88BC544D558AC70B4E0002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다시 말해, 어둠대신의 힘을 빌려서\n부정적인 감정이 넘치는 사람을 발견하면...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C2DC0020B9D0D574002C0020C5B4B460B300C2E0C7580020D798C7440020BE4CB824C11C000ABD80C815C801C7780020AC10C815C7740020B118CE58B2940020C0ACB78CC7440020BC1CACACD558BA74002E002E002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "범인을 체포하거나 사건을\n미연에 방지할 수 있을지도 모른다는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC94C778C7440020CCB4D3ECD558AC70B0980020C0ACAC74C744000ABBF8C5F0C5D00020BC29C9C0D5600020C2180020C788C744C9C0B3C40020BAA8B978B2E4B2940020AC70C57C002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네게도 협조를 부탁할게!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n어둠대신을 데리고 있다면\n내게 한 마리만 양보해 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC8CB3C40020D611C870B97C0020BD80D0C1D560AC8C002100100001BE01000AC5B4B460B300C2E0C7440020B370B9ACACE00020C788B2E4BA74000AB0B4AC8C0020D55C0020B9C8B9ACB9CC0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어둠대신을\n내게 양보해 줄 거니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B460B300C2E0C744000AB0B4AC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C9040020AC70B2C8003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8C694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오!\n어느 어둠대신을 줄 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C6240021000AC5B4B2900020C5B4B460B300C2E0C7440020C9040020AC70C9C0003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어둠대신의 힘을 빌릴 수만 있다면\n수사가 수월해질 텐데 말이지...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B460B300C2E0C7580020D798C7440020BE4CB9B40020C218B9CC0020C788B2E4BA74000AC218C0ACAC000020C218C6D4D574C9C80020D150B3700020B9D0C774C9C0002E002E002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네가 어둠대신이구나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC000020C5B4B460B300C2E0C774AD6CB0980021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르의 평화는 네게 달렸어!\n너의 힘을 빌려주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C7580020D3C9D654B2940020B124AC8C0020B2ECB838C5B40021000AB108C7580020D798C7440020BE4CB824C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이야... 이렇게나 크다니!\n너라면 미르의 평화는 걱정할 것 없겠는데!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C57C002E002E002E0020C774B807AC8CB0980020D06CB2E4B2C80021000AB108B77CBA740020BBF8B974C7580020D3C9D654B2940020AC71C815D5600020AC830020C5C6ACA0B294B3700021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 바로 도움이 될 거라고는\n기대하고 있지 않지만.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020BC14B85C0020B3C4C6C0C7740020B4200020AC70B77CACE0B294000AAE30B300D558ACE00020C788C9C00020C54AC9C0B9CC002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두움!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B450C6C000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "벌써 부정적인 감정을 감지해 낸 건가!?\n좋아! 따라가 보자!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC8CC3680020BD80C815C801C7780020AC10C815C7440020AC10C9C0D5740020B0B80020AC74AC000021003F000AC88BC54400210020B530B77CAC000020BCF4C7900021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이... 이게 어떻게 된 거지?\n여기는... 우리 집이잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774002E002E002E0020C774AC8C0020C5B4B5BBAC8C0020B41C0020AC70C9C0003F000AC5ECAE30B294002E002E002E0020C6B0B9AC0020C9D1C774C796C5440021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두움!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B450C6C000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머, 벌써 퇴근한 거야?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38002C0020BC8CC3680020D1F4ADFCD55C0020AC70C57C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니... 아직 수사 중이야.\n혹시 수상한 녀석 못 봤어?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8002E002E002E0020C544C9C10020C218C0AC0020C911C774C57C002E000AD639C2DC0020C218C0C1D55C0020B140C11D0020BABB0020BD24C5B4003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아직도 근무 중이시다...?\n어디, 열심히 수사해 봐.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C9C1B3C40020ADFCBB340020C911C774C2DCB2E4002E002E002E003F000AC5B4B514002C0020C5F4C2ECD7880020C218C0ACD5740020BD10002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두움!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B450C6C00021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어... 어째서\n우리 마누라한테 반응하는 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4002E002E002E0020C5B4C9F8C11C000AC6B0B9AC0020B9C8B204B77CD55CD14C0020BC18C751D558B2940020AC70C9C0003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "얄궂은 어둠대신이네...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n내가 오랫동안 억눌러 온\n추악한 감정들에 반응하고 말이야...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C584AD82C7400020C5B4B460B300C2E0C774B124002E002E002E00100001BE01000AB0B4AC000020C624B7ABB3D9C5480020C5B5B20CB7EC0020C628000ACD94C545D55C0020AC10C815B4E4C5D00020BC18C751D558ACE00020B9D0C774C57C002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "설마...\n그, 그랬던 거야...!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C124B9C8002E002E002E000AADF8002C0020ADF8B7ACB3580020AC70C57C002E002E002E0021003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아내는 일에 파묻혀 사는 나를 응원하면서도\n속으로는 원망하고 있던 모양이야...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그렇게 억눌러 왔던 감정은\n원한으로 발전하고 있었던 거고...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어둠대신이 그런 아내의\n부정적인 감정을 감지해 낸 거지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B460B300C2E0C7740020ADF8B7F00020C544B0B4C758000ABD80C815C801C7780020AC10C815C7440020AC10C9C0D5740020B0B80020AC70C9C0002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두움!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B450C6C000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오랫동안 함께 살았으니\n서로를 이해하고 있다고 생각했었어...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B7ABB3D9C5480020D568AED80020C0B4C558C73CB2C8000AC11CB85CB97C0020C774D574D558ACE00020C788B2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D588C5C8C5B4002E002E002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 실은 일밖에 몰랐던 거야.\n아내가 원망하고 있을 줄 전혀 몰랐으니...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n나도 아직 사람이 되려면 멀었군.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020C2E4C7400020C77CBC16C5D00020BAB0B790B3580020AC70C57C002E000AC544B0B4AC000020C6D0B9DDD558ACE00020C788C7440020C9040020C804D6000020BAB0B790C73CB2C8002E002E002E00100001BE00000AB098B3C40020C544C9C10020C0ACB78CC7740020B418B824BA740020BA40C5C8AD70002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어둠대신,\n앞으로도 많이 도와줬으면 해.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B460B300C2E0002C000AC55EC73CB85CB3C40020B9CEC7740020B3C4C640C92CC73CBA740020D574002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아내가 감정을 억누르지 않아도 되게,\n내가 좋은 남편이 될 수 있게,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n무슨 일 있으면 내게 알려 줘, 알겠지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B0B4AC000020AC10C815C7440020C5B5B204B974C9C00020C54AC544B3C40020B418AC8C002C000AB0B4AC000020C88BC7400020B0A8D3B8C7740020B4200020C2180020C788AC8C002C00100001BE00000ABB34C2A80020C77C0020C788C73CBA740020B0B4AC8C0020C54CB8240020C918002C0020C54CACA0C9C0003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안 좋은 생각을 하는\n제 자신이 싫을 때가 있어요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5480020C88BC7400020C0DDAC01C7440020D558B294000AC81C0020C790C2E0C7740020C2EBC7440020B54CAC000020C788C5B4C694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두움!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B450C6C000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어둠대신에게는 미안하지만, 아내에게\n부정적인 감정이 생기지 않도록 노력할 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
